&lt;li&gt;Update SFDC daily with all relevant details needed to reflect business reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bring: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bachelors Degree or equivalent experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ideally 2+ years of closing experience, within SaaS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Must be a true hunter!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Must be willing to work out of the NYC or Santa Barbara office 3x a week, at the minimum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Independent person with the desire to excel in a competitive and highly rewarding industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong communication, effective problem-solving, networking and presentation skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of building territories and addressing client needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;MUST HAVE knowledge of MEDDPICC or similar sales methodology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience handling objections at multiple levels of enterprise organizations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;$150-$190K OTE &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;potential&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;total on target earnings (base + commission), per year, plus eligibility to receive Restricted Stock Unit (RSU) grant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
