&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office-only catered lunch every Thursday,&lt;/strong&gt; a healthy snack bar, and great coffee to keep you fueled&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible spending accounts and 401(k)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
