&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About impact.com:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://impact.com/&quot;&gt;impact.com&lt;/a&gt; is the world’s leading commerce partnership marketing platform, transforming the way businesses grow by enabling them to discover, manage, and scale partnerships across the entire customer journey. From affiliates and influencers to content publishers, brand ambassadors, and customer advocates, &lt;a href=&quot;http://impact.com/&quot;&gt;impact.com&lt;/a&gt; empowers brands to drive trusted, performance-based growth through authentic relationships. Its award-winning products &lt;strong&gt;Performance&lt;/strong&gt; (affiliate), &lt;strong&gt;Creator&lt;/strong&gt; (influencer), and &lt;strong&gt;Advocate&lt;/strong&gt; (customer referral) unify every type of partner into one integrated platform. As consumers increasingly rely on recommendations from people and communities they trust,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://impact.com/&quot;&gt;impact.com&lt;/a&gt; helps brands show up where it matters most. Today, over 5,000 global brands, including Walmart, Uber, Shopify, Lenovo, L’Oréal, and Fanatics, rely on &lt;a href=&quot;http://impact.com/&quot;&gt;impact.com&lt;/a&gt; to power more than 225,000 partnerships that deliver measurable business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role impact.com:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Associate Software Engineer in our Oslo innovation team, you&#39;ll help build the platform that powers performance partnerships for thousands of brands and publishers globally. You&#39;ll work on backend services, data pipelines, and user-facing applications that process partnership and conversion data at scale, alongside more experienced engineers who will help you grow toward independent delivery. This role assumes that you have strong engineering fundamentals from your degree and the ability to learn quickly. You will build familiarity with our cloud services, libraries, and APIs, and take on problems of increasing scope and complexity over time. You will write clean, well-tested code and contribute to the quality of the codebase. You are motivated by solving interesting problems at scale, building solutions that have real impact, and applying new technologies&amp;nbsp; including AI and machine learning to the problems we work on. You communicate effectively, including when you need help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop code in collaboration with others, taking on increasing independence over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support software testing and quality assurance processes to ensure high-quality deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review business needs, requirements, and technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to alerts, review error messages, and fix bugs in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and prototype new technologies, including AI and machine learning approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to and maintain technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completed or near-completion B.S. or M.S. in Computer Science, Informatics, Cybernetics, or related engineering field. Strong academic results, extracurricular activities, and military service are all viewed favourably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fundamentals in data structures, algorithms, OOP, and software design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with at least one general-purpose programming language through coursework, thesis, internships, or substantial personal projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of relational databases and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI and machine learning, with some exposure through coursework, thesis topics, or projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with version control (Git) and exposure to Continuous Integration/Delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in Norwegian and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Agile ways of working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
