&lt;li&gt;Administer and support multiple MySQL database clusters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer and support sharded MySQL database clusters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage database capacity and usage. Pro-active capacity planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and optimize database performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop backup and recovery procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Essential Database administration - install, configure, upgrade, backup, partitioning and monitoring of MySQL, Postgres, MongoDB and Clickhouse database clusters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ProxySQL administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with developers during application development life cycle in the design and planning of schema, tables, data types, indexes, procedures and functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify performance bottlenecks and database risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benchmarking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in mathematics, statistics, economics, computer science or a related field, or relevant professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3+ years’ experience as a production Database Administrator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience with MySQL / Percona Server 5.1, 5.5, 5.6, 5.7, 8.0, 8.4 / CloudSQL / AWS RDS MySQL/Postgres and Aurora&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience with Postgres&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience with Clickhouse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ProxySQL 2.x, 3.x / Orchestrator, Percona XtraBackup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in writing Linux shell scripts, perl scripts, Python etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with High Availability MySQL/Percona environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Large Data Volumes - 100’s of Terabytes to Petabytes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of InnoDB and InnoDB tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SingleStore, MongoDB, Percona XtraDB Cluster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Puppet, Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice To Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://pxa.impact.com/student/path/1099626-affiliate-partnerships-industry-fundamentals-certification-path?utm_source=impact.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=featured-link&amp;amp;utm_content=fund-lp-100&amp;amp;utm_campaign=job-description&quot;&gt;Affiliate &amp;amp; Partnerships Industry Fundamentals Certification&lt;/a&gt; by PXA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
