&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and Wellness: &lt;/strong&gt;Your well-being is a priority. Our mental health and wellness benefit includes up to 12 fully covered therapy/coaching sessions per year, with additional dependent coverage. We also offer a monthly gym reimbursement policy to support your physical health.&lt;/li&gt;
