&lt;li&gt;ISTQB/ISEB (Pref)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years of experience in developing RESTful APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of test automation experience: Selenium, Jasmine, POM, Cucumber&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified in Java, Spring or AWS technologies (Pref)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have:&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://pxa.impact.com/student/path/1099626-affiliate-partnerships-industry-fundamentals-certification-path?utm_source=impact.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=featured-link&amp;amp;utm_content=fund-lp-100&amp;amp;utm_campaign=job-description&quot;&gt;Affiliate &amp;amp; Partnerships Industry Fundamentals Certification&lt;/a&gt; by PXA&lt;/li&gt;
