&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About impact.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;impact.com is the world’s leading commerce partnership marketing platform, transforming the way businesses grow by enabling them to discover, manage, and scale partnerships across the entire customer journey. From affiliates and influencers to content publishers, brand ambassadors, and customer advocates, impact.com empowers brands to drive trusted, performance-based growth through authentic relationships. Its award-winning products - Performance (affiliate), Creator (influencer), and Advocate (customer referral) - unify every type of partner into one integrated platform. As consumers increasingly rely on recommendations from people and communities they trust, impact.com helps brands show up where it matters most. Today, over 5,000 global brands - including Walmart, Uber, Shopify, Lenovo, L’Oréal, and Fanatics - rely on &lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fimpact.com&amp;amp;esheet=54399906&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260120914149&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=impact.com&amp;amp;index=38&amp;amp;md5=c467739484a5a8610aff0747572ac8cb&quot;&gt;impact.com&lt;/a&gt; to power more than 350,000 partnerships that deliver measurable business results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role at &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://impact.com&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;impact.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Strategic Program Manager is a high-leverage leader within the global Strategy Team. The primary mission of this role spans three core areas:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bet Roadmap Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the strategic representative and program leader for our critical &quot;Bets&quot; (e.g., Retail Media). Define, coordinate, and govern the cross-functional roadmaps required to launch and scale these adjacent bets successfully.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTMD &amp;amp; Strategy Implementation (SDM Focus): &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the Strategy Delivery Manager initially coupled to the Go-To-Market Delivery (GTMD) organization. Partner with local, regional, and commercial operations to analyze performance, de-risk execution, and unlock revenue-generating opportunities through targeted strategic projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General Strategy Project Work: &lt;/strong&gt;Support decision-making through rigorous, data-driven frameworks and ensure that once a decision is made, the operational engine executes it with precision, predictability, and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Bet Roadmap Management &amp;amp; PMO Governance (40%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Program Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the lifecycle of major, cross-functional programs under the &quot;Bets&quot; framework from initial scoping and business case development through to final operationalization and launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media Bet Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Directly manage the Bet Roadmap for the Retail Media Bet, specifically supporting Frank and ensuring alignment across all involved stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Roadmap Integration: &lt;/strong&gt;Construct and maintain unified program roadmaps, aligning deliverables across Engineering, Product, Marketing, Sales, and Customer Success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Dependency Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactively identify and manage system-wide dependencies, resource constraints, and operational bottlenecks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication &amp;amp; Status Reporting: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish structured, lightweight status-reporting cadences to keep L1 and L2 leadership informed of program health and milestone progress.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Strategy Projects &amp;amp; GTMD Implementation (SDM Focus) (30%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTMD Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the dedicated SDM coupled to the GTMD organization, ensuring strategic initiatives are effectively translated into market-facing execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Expansion Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead critical analysis on elasticity pricing models and conduct comprehensive international expansion analysis to guide new market entry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account &amp;amp; Segment Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive stubborn accounts analysis to identify retention and growth blockers. Work closely with specific verticals and segments to tailor strategies that improve penetration and yield.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue &amp;amp; Retention Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with the Chief Revenue Officer (CRO), VP of GTM, and the Head of Renewals to design, test, and execute strategic client retention and expansion programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Process Design (20%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyze current-state cross-functional operations and design optimized, highly scalable &quot;Ways of Working&quot; (WoW) to support new strategic capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational De-Risking: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct post-mortems, program-level audits, and operational readiness reviews to evaluate the quality and stability of strategic program rollouts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jira &amp;amp; Tooling Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Standardize program-level tracking within Jira and Confluence, ensuring program data flows cleanly from execution squads up to strategic portfolio dashboards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. General Strategy Team Support &amp;amp; Secondary Duties (10%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ad-Hoc Strategic Projects: &lt;/strong&gt;Support the wider Strategy Team with market and competitive intelligence, thematic deep dives, financial scenario modeling (with FP&amp;amp;A), and macro business analysis as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Mentor junior team members, assist with recruiting top-tier talent to the Strategy &amp;amp; Operations organization, and foster a culture of high performance and psychological safety.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, Management, Engineering, or a highly analytical field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;6+ years of professional experience, ideally combining:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3–4 years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;in top-tier Management Consulting, Corporate Strategy, or an executive-facing advisory role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3–4 years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;in an operational program management, product operations, or PMO leadership role within a high-growth technology/SaaS company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Program Management Expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of managing highly complex, multi-million dollar initiatives involving matrixed, cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analytical Rigor:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced financial and scenario modeling skills; ability to distill ambiguous data sets (e.g., pricing elasticity, stubborn accounts) into clear, actionable business recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Management:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Exceptional interpersonal and communication skills, with a demonstrated ability to influence without authority and build alignment across Director- and C-suite levels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Travel Requirement:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Comfort with traveling up to 10% as needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in Business Administration (MBA), Finance, or a related graduate degree.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Formal certification in Program/Project Management (e.g., PMP, PgMP, PMI-ACP, or CSM).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with structured innovation frameworks, OKR methodologies, or Agile-at-scale frameworks in a SaaS environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency using AI productivity tools (e.g., Cursor, Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot) to accelerate personal output, documentation, and analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
