&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with a track record of translating complex technical states into concise, clear updates for executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; Project Management Professional (PMP), Agile Certified Practitioner (PMI-ACP), Certified ScrumMaster (CSM), or equivalent professional project management credentials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Technology Exposure:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with LLM-based product workflows, prompt engineering, RAG pipelines, or model fine-tuning processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience navigating a rapidly scaling B2B SaaS platform or multi-sided marketplace business model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Context:&lt;/strong&gt; High-level understanding of cloud infrastructure (AWS or GCP), CI/CD pipelines, and microservices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience helping to build or mature a TPM function, project management office, or shared delivery playbook from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
